# Sales & Profit Dashboard

## Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard provides insights into sales performance, profitability, customer behaviour, and product performance.

It enables decision-makers to monitor business performance through interactive reports.

## Business Problem

Businesses generate large volumes of transactional data but often struggle to convert it into actionable insights.

This dashboard simplifies analysis by presenting key performance indicators and trends.

## Objectives

- Analyse sales performance
- Monitor profitability
- Track customer trends
- Evaluate product performance
- Support strategic business decisions

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- SQL Server
- Excel
- Power Query
- DAX

## Features

- Sales Overview
- Profit Analysis
- Customer Insights
- Product Performance
- Regional Analysis
- KPI Dashboard

